'''Fallen Warriors''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in the [[Deep North]].

== Drops ==
{{CreatureDrops|stars=0}}
The Essence drop chances are independent, it's possible for a single warrior to drop both at the same time, or none.

==Spawning==
* Summoned at a [[Memorial Site]]s in exchange for {{Item link|Memorial Coal|3}}.

==Variant==
